# Diary / letter pager

When working in these files (or on clipping, caret, Enter/Backspace at page edges, justify-under-scale, spill/absorb):

1. Read and follow `.cursor/skills/diary-letter-pager/SKILL.md` (and `reference.md` when linked).
2. **Never** change the persisted diary shape away from `pages[]` / add a parallel stream field / invent a print layout besides live-clone.
3. Left column stays a **textarea**. Fit = static cut + **live peel**; absorb = **one line/block** into slack — not greedy full-column re-cut.
4. Gate with `npm test` and `npx playwright test tests/diary-pagination.spec.js tests/print-parity.spec.js`.
